# Phase 73: Collective Inception (Proactive Autonomy)

Phase 73 initiates the "Hive Mind Apex," transitioning the Swarm from reactive automation to **Proactive Outcome Ownership**. This creates a system that senses its environment, synthesizes its own objectives, and triggers its own growth cycles.

## Proposed Changes

### [Swarm Core]

#### [NEW] [reality_sensor.ts](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/swarm/core/reality_sensor.ts)
- Implement `RealitySensor` mesh.
- Monitors:
  - **GitHub Activity:** (via local `git` or mock API) for new issues/PRs.
  - **Market Signals:** (via Crypto metrics) for volatility shifts.
  - **System Telemetry:** For bottlenecks or error red flags.

#### [MODIFY] [singularity_engine.ts](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/swarm/core/singularity_engine.ts)
- Implement `ObjectiveSynthesizer` (The Inception Layer).
- Logic: Oracle uses environment delta (from Reality Sensor) to generate a "Highest Value Objective".
- If a vulnerability/improvement is sensed, it autonomously generates a bounty.

#### [MODIFY] [economic_engine.ts](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/swarm/core/economic_engine.ts)
- Integrate Policy Optimization Formula for reward calculation:
  $$\max_{\pi} \mathbb{E}_{\pi}\left[\sum_{t=0}^T \gamma^t r_t\right]$$
- Ensures long-term "Sovereign Utility" prioritization.

#### [MODIFY] [loop.ts](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/swarm/core/loop.ts)
- Implement `Self-Triggering Cycles`.
- Loop will bypass sleep intervals if a critical "Inception Event" is detected by the Reality Sensor.

